request:
everything under the prefix `k/`, whose end key is `k0`

POST /v3/kv/range
{
  "key": "ay8=",
  "range_end": "azA="
}

response:
the pairs in byte order, with a count of how many the range holds

HTTP 200 OK
{
  "count": "3",
  "header": {
    "cluster_id": "9792985300700761121",
    "member_id": "8294125526620071324",
    "raft_term": "2",
    "revision": "4"
  },
  "kvs": [
    {
      "create_revision": "2",
      "key": "ay9h",
      "mod_revision": "2",
      "value": "MQ==",
      "version": "1"
    },
    {
      "create_revision": "3",
      "key": "ay9i",
      "mod_revision": "3",
      "value": "Mg==",
      "version": "1"
    },
    {
